2026-10-02T16:57:59.0832675Z   ok   Saturday, Sunday and Monday are all inside a Fri-Mon wrap
2026-10-02T16:57:59.0832803Z   ok   Tuesday is outside a Fri-Mon wrap
2026-10-02T16:57:59.0832931Z   ok   a Fri-Mon wrap is not silently empty
2026-10-02T16:57:59.0833109Z   ok   the synthetic fold day really carries 25 hourly entries
2026-10-02T16:57:59.0833249Z   ok   a plain 24-hour day trains the hourly shape
