2026-10-02T16:57:59.0834778Z -- v4.0.4 — negative-mean initial guess
2026-10-02T16:57:59.0834997Z   ok   a positive-mean horizon gets the historical formula bit for bit
2026-10-02T16:57:59.0835228Z   ok   all-negative prices: the cheapest (most negative) step starts highest
