2026-10-02T17:03:41.9581816Z 
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9582149Z -- Slot parsing and validation
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9582603Z   ok   omitted channel stays None (fully automatic)
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9583127Z   ok   explicit empty list stays [] (off for the whole period)
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9583598Z   ok   slots are sorted by start time
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9584244Z   ok   rejects end == start
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9584963Z   ok   rejects end < start
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9585516Z   ok   rejects overlapping slots
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9586021Z   ok   rejects unparseable datetime
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9586356Z   ok   rejects a non-object slot
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9586678Z   ok   rejects expires_at in the past
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9587031Z   ok   ManualPlanError is a ValueError
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9587237Z 
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9587368Z -- Channel pin semantics
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9587670Z   ok   omitted channel yields no pins
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9588017Z   ok   supplied channel yields a pin array
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9588362Z   ok   pins on inside the slot
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9588707Z   ok   pins off outside the slot but before expiry
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9589082Z   ok   free at and beyond expiry
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9589409Z   ok   pinned_step_count counts the on steps
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9589807Z   ok   empty list forces off up to expiry
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9590382Z   ok   empty list still frees steps past expiry
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9590817Z   ok   a slot starting mid-step pins the step it lands in ON
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9591293Z   ok   and the partially covered trailing step stays ON too
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9591595Z 
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9591722Z -- Serialisation round-trip
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9592084Z   ok   space channel empty-list survives the round-trip
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9592503Z   ok   dhw channel slots survive the round-trip
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9592865Z   ok   expiry survives the round-trip
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9593206Z   ok   from_dict rejects a missing expiry
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9593416Z 
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9593575Z -- Pins change the solved schedule
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9593952Z   ok   forcing space on adds a run the optimizer skipped
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9594358Z   ok   a manual-on step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9594868Z   ok   the override is flagged active
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9595208Z   ok   forcing hot water on adds a DHW run
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9595587Z   ok   a manual DHW step is labelled manual_plan
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9596021Z   ok   the summer plan has several runs, so the last one is a real choice
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9596443Z   ok   forcing hot water off removes a run when safe
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9596787Z   ok   a safe forced-off step is not released
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9596980Z 
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9597169Z -- Safety release fires only when a hard floor binds
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9597598Z   ok   forcing space off in the cold releases pins for the comfort floor
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9598004Z   ok   released space steps actually run again
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9598383Z   ok   forcing space off when it is not needed releases nothing
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9598802Z   ok   forcing hot water off with a low tank releases pins
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9599192Z   ok   a due legionella cycle is released when forced off
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9599607Z   ok   forcing hot water off when the tank is hot releases nothing
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9599865Z 
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9600055Z -- A timezone-less expiry is handled, not crashed on
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9600407Z   ok   a naive expiry does not raise TypeError
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9600783Z   ok   the stored expiry is comparable with the parsed slots
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9601183Z   ok   and the override can still be applied to the horizon
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9601588Z   ok   a naive expiry in the past is rejected as a plan error
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9601826Z 
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9602049Z -- Abandoning an unsafe plan does not discard the safe channel
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9602426Z   ok   the breaching channel is abandoned
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9602764Z   ok   the channel that was never unsafe keeps its pins
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9603135Z   ok   so the space plan the user asked for still holds
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9603349Z 
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9603578Z -- A released pin is never reported without being planned around
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9603978Z   ok   a plan that never converges still terminates
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9604463Z   ok   giving up releases every forced-off slot
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9604978Z   ok   the abandoned plan is as warm as planning freely
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9605351Z   ok   and it heats about as much as planning freely
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9605563Z 
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9605715Z -- No override leaves behaviour unchanged
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9606101Z   ok   winter_dhw: passing no pins is byte-for-byte identical
2026-10-02T17:03:41.9606501Z   ok   winter_dhw: no pins means the override is inactive
